OL,3,GNEWSATeens take to skies as flying made
OL,4,Amore accessible
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who has recently taken to
OL,7,Fthe skies says flying a microlight
OL,8,Fplane is "like being on a
OL,9,Frollercoaster... but more fun".
OL,11,FIzzy, 13, from Salisbury in Wiltshire,
OL,12,Fis one of 2,000 pupils, aged 11 to
OL,13,F16-years-old, being given the chance to
OL,14,Flearn aviation skills.
OL,16,FBritish Young Pilots (BYP), which began
OL,17,Fin the West Midlands, said it was
OL,18,Ftrying to make flying as accessible as
OL,19,Fpossible to every young person,
OL,20,Fwhatever their background.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
