OL,3,GNEWSATeens take to skies as flying made
OL,4,Amore accessible
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing her first flight, Izzy, who
OL,7,Fhas autism and ADHD, said: "I'm proud
OL,8,Fof myself. I don't usually have
OL,9,Fanything to feel proud of."
